{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261103%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　34庭　法官郭啟安<br/>28歲男子被控謀殺女瑜伽導師｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　32庭　法官陳廣池<br/>元朗區議員施駿興與女童非法性交罪成｜判刑<br/>► 1100　27庭　法官嚴舜儀<br/>警方私家車涉撞斃六旬漢　男警被控不小心駕駛｜提訊</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 1100　7庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>休班警涉荔景站偷拍女子裙底｜裁決</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官余俊翔<br/>22歲男子涉使用虛假理大成績表及畢業證書｜再提堂<br/>44歲尼泊爾籍男去年除夕　星光大道近金像獎座銅像自瀆｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 1430　1庭　署理主任裁判官 李志豪<br/>被指濫發免針紙西醫戴港盛　涉於將軍澳超市盜竊｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T15:21:13.292498+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":422,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:46:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.354321+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:18:11.963704+00:00","content_hash":"f03855e53bf52862e61d22e04e20f9e209ced6607d8b7938ab42954443b4e4bd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}